        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is circulating in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the distant wind blew from the other side of the ocean, the mysterious East brought gorgeous satin, porcelain, and - miracles. A small number of people worshipped it as a god, but more people were afraid of it. People held up sickles and torches, avoiding it as if they saw a medieval wizard, and spurned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many years later, people forgot about it, and the miracle eventually became a distant rumor and disappeared in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the fictional Europe at the end of the 19th century. The player will play the role of a teenager working in a pet store. One day, he accidentally stepped into a mysterious toy store and discovered a strange and unusual thing. From then on, his fate began to turn - miracle? Rumor? Resurrection from the dead? The player gradually explores the truth in his contact with the three shop assistants. Maybe... things are not as simple as you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the foggy city, in the silent night, there is a light guiding the lost pedestrians. Love and sadness are intertwined, gradually revealing the truth about a fire five years ago. The resurrected dead, the incomplete memories, the familiar appearance, is it sin or redemption? And are they annihilated or reborn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the invisible power and explore the story in the toy store. The truth... may be even sadder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a European extra chapter of the &quot;Oriental Dreams&quot; series. When the ancient jade from Qiyunzhou flows overseas, the mysterious oriental power will open a new chapter.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is circulating in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the distant wind blew from the other side of the ocean, the mysterious East brought gorgeous satin, porcelain, and - miracles. A small number of people worshipped it as a god, but more people were afraid of it. People held up sickles and torches, avoiding it as if they saw a medieval wizard, and spurned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many years later, people forgot about it, and the miracle eventually became a distant rumor and disappeared in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the fictional Europe at the end of the 19th century. The player will play the role of a teenager working in a pet store. One day, he accidentally stepped into a mysterious toy store and discovered a strange and unusual thing. From then on, his fate began to turn - miracle? Rumor? Resurrection from the dead? The player gradually explores the truth in his contact with the three shop assistants. Maybe... things are not as simple as you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the foggy city, in the silent night, there is a light guiding the lost pedestrians. Love and sadness are intertwined, gradually revealing the truth about a fire five years ago. The resurrected dead, the incomplete memories, the familiar appearance, is it sin or redemption? And are they annihilated or reborn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the invisible power and explore the story in the toy store. The truth... may be even sadder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a European extra chapter of the &quot;Oriental Dreams&quot; series. When the ancient jade from Qiyunzhou flows overseas, the mysterious oriental power will open a new chapter.</p>",
        "short_description": "This is an AVG narrative puzzle game, the story background is set in the late 19th century Europe, players will experience it as the protagonist . The game is divided into three main lines and one hidden line.",
        "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“本作是叙事解谜游戏栖云系列的新作，油画岩彩风格的美术十分亮眼，全程中文配音也颇有诚意，整体故事讲述很完整，结局内容设计也非常丰富，除了好结局外还提供了很多坏结局，想要探索完全部结局需要花一番功夫。尽管本作的解谜几乎没有太多提示，但玩家可以直接选择跳过，即便是解谜游戏苦手也能专注于剧情。总的来说，本作的整体质量很不错，推荐解谜爱好者和剧情向游戏爱好者都来试试”<br>8 – 游戏好声音<br>",
